+    ) -> None:
+        """Outsider WITH a ``user_effective_team_access`` row for the target
+        team can cite the memory in that team.
+
+        Uses ``assign_role`` (not raw SQL) to provision the outsider's team
+        membership, which calls ``sync_refresh_on_user_assignment`` and
+        populates the cache row. The access rule's team-access branch handles
+        this case.
